    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Handle the states for a particular particle (or &quot;class&quot; of particles. For example a state enumerator class could take a bounding box and a number,n, and generate n points in the bounding box. Then the get_number function would return n and update_to_state would modify the particle to have the coordinates for state i. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
